  "description": "A peer-to-peer messaging engine that connects nodes over IP with the Mercury Secure Message Transport (MSMT) protocol or point-to-point over MicroGate serial cables, with a built-in Avalonia desktop GUI. Avalonia is a required dependency of this package, not optional - it can be run headless (no window shown), but the GUI layer and its dependencies are always present. Also has fakes of every context the engine hands to a host's handlers and of every service it offers, in the BlueHeighliner.Comlink.Testing namespace, for unit testing custom handlers without running the engine.",
